00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:37.060
Yes, the threat of Runny Diarrhea has been avoided.

00:09:37.060 --> 00:09:38.030
The hell it has!

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:38.960
They ignored it!

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:41.210
They ignored it and started B'z instead!

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:42.940
Okay, time to get serious.

00:09:43.170 --> 00:09:44.760
What should we try next?

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:46.130
You still want to continue?

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:48.160
His name is too long already.

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:50.950
Yes, let's try...

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:52.950
Okay, finished.

