00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:00.340
of the loft next to a sliding shower curtain ring!

00:15:00.340 --> 00:15:03.840
I'm like a leftover sliding shower curtain ring!

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.500
The curtain has no room for me!

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:07.850
But when it slides left or right, I still get pushed along!

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:09.660
Sliding between the dojo and the loft!

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:13.120
I'm like a sliding ring that slides until it dies!

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.900
I'm sliding!

00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:16.320
But it's a slidin' shame!

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:17.400
'Cause I slide!

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:19.780
Enough with the slidin' already!

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:22.210
Why did you come here?!

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:24.610
Nothing's changed at all!

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:26.280
Go slide yourself off in a soapland!

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:28.000
That's right.

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:30.290
How can you be jealous of a monkey?

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:33.770
And this is a good experience for Kyubei-san.

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:38.040
You were the one who wanted her to act more like a girl.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:41.800
That's right! Kyu-chan's never looked like this before!

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:43.010
Shut up!

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:45.100
What would you know?!

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:47.220
In that case, tell me this!

00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:51.170
A monkey's ass looks cute in anime,

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:54.330
but in real life, it's all rough and gross!

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:55.770
It's damn sick!

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:58.270
What is he even talking about?

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:00.320
When I think about how that filthy ass

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:02.450
has been rubbing up against the lady's shoulder,

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:04.050
I just... I just...

00:16:06.010 --> 00:16:07.930
Feel so jealous.

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:10.780
Hey, Kagura. Make his ass all rough and gross.

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:13.580
That hurts!

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:15.630
Hey, this isn't funny!

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:16.750
I'm sorry! Forgive me!

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:17.750
Not there!

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:22.890
Regardless, I long to turn that monkey into monkey soup.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:25.430
However, he is a member of the shogun's family.

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:27.260
I can not lay a finger on him.

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:29.860
It pains me to admit this, but the monkey may

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:32.260
be having a positive effect on the lady.

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:36.270
But I haven't told her this yet...

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:38.640
I have bad news for her.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:41.600
Though it's good news for me.

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:45.780
The shogun's family has requested the return of the monkey.

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:51.780
You heard that the monkey was supposed to be a gift to a relative, right?

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:58.790
Apparently, they've heard that the monkey has been trained,

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:03.300
